Bugfix: Retried automatic uploads end in conflict

The destination folder for automatic uploads has now been created before the file is uploaded again, so retrying a failed automatic upload no longer ends in conflict when the folder does not exist yet. The double separator in the remote path of automatic uploads has also been fixed when the destination folder path ends with a separator.

